# Follow AGENTS.md

Before writing or changing code in this repository, follow **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root.

That file is mandatory for Cursor and Claude agents. It defines:

- Scalable project structure (`features/`, `lib/`, `hooks/`, `stores/`)
- React / Next.js best practices (DRY UI, hooks, React Query, RHF+Zod)
- Backend layering (controller → service → repository)
- TypeScript, testing, security, and definition of done

Do not invent parallel patterns. Reuse shared modules. Keep diffs focused. Prefer small feature files over mega-files.
